# Findings of the Trivy scan in the central CI pipeline that sit in the newest upstream release of the base image
# (docker.io/codercom/code-server:4.143.1; checked on Docker Hub 2026-10-24: no newer tag exists): the Go standard
# library of a bundled binary (fixuid) and a few Node packages bundled with code-server. They cannot be fixed here without
# patching the upstream image. Every entry expires on 2026-11-30: the build fails again then, so somebody has to look
# at the new upstream release. Remove entries as upstream releases the fixes.

